<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Assassin's Creed Origins — Laboratorio Narrativo & Mitigación</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #0f1016;
      --bg-card: #181924;
      --bg-hover: #222436;
      --gold: #d4af37;
      --gold-light: #f3e5ab;
      --sand: #c29b38;
      --text: #e6e6eb;
      --text-muted: #9a9ab0;
      --accent-red: #e74c3c;
      --accent-green: #2ecc71;
      --accent-blue: #3498db;
      --border: #2d2f45;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-dark);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    header {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1f2030 0%, var(--bg-dark) 100%);
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold);
      padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    }
    .header-inner {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .logo {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--gold);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .logo span { color: var(--gold-light); font-weight: 300; font-size: 0.9em; }
    nav { display: flex; gap: 0.8rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    nav a {
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background-color: var(--bg-card);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    nav a:hover {
      background-color: var(--gold);
      color: #000;
      border-color: var(--gold);
    }
    main {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 2rem auto;
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
    }
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1c1d2d 0%, #12131c 100%);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--gold);
      padding: 2rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .hero p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .stat-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1.2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .stat-card .num { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--gold); }
    .stat-card .lbl { font-size: 0.85rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .act-section { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
    .act-title {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      color: var(--gold-light);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .episode-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(350px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.2rem;
    }
    .card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1.2rem;
      transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: var(--gold);
      background: var(--bg-hover);
    }
    .card h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .card .meta { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.8rem; display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .badge-gold { background: #4a3b00; color: var(--gold-light); border: 1px solid var(--gold); }
    .badge-red { background: #4a1111; color: #ff9999; border: 1px solid var(--accent-red); }
    .badge-green { background: #0e3d1e; color: #99ffbb; border: 1px solid var(--accent-green); }
    .badge-blue { background: #102e4d; color: #99ccff; border: 1px solid var(--accent-blue); }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      text-align: center;
      background: var(--gold);
      color: #000;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .btn:hover { background: var(--gold-light); }
    .box-spoiler { background: #261515; border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-red); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; margin: 1rem 0; }
    .box-mitigation { background: #132418; border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-green); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; margin: 1rem 0; }
    .box-easter { background: #1b2030; border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-blue); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; margin: 1rem 0; }
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="header-inner">
      <a href="/" class="logo">Origins Lab <span>// Assassin's Creed Origins</span></a>
      <nav>
        <a href="/">Episodios (1-21)</a>
        <a href="/side-quests">Misiones Secundarias</a>
        <a href="/trophies">Trofeos & Platino</a>
        <a href="/easter-eggs">Easter Eggs</a>
        <a href="/mitigations">Mitigación & Prevención</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <%= yield %>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>Assassin's Creed Origins — Laboratorio Narrativo, Continuidad de Lore & Protocolos de Mitigación Táctica.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.75rem;">Modelado con Ruby 3 & Sinatra. <em>"Nada es verdad, todo está permitido."</em></p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
